From 2f5b3fa1b56a48a7d5e5426d169b03e97aedd031 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:36:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild Guide UI from measured reference: gold chrome, Player
 page, tab ring, list/file views

- GuideChrome: silhouette, header/footer bands, rules and tab shoulder from point tables measured on the reference
- GuideUi/Overlay: gamer card, Community, media transport, plate, footer hints, windowed lists
- Navigation: sub-views with B/Esc back, LB/RB tabs, X contextual, clean state on every open, focus restore
- File browser: keeps path/parent/drives, errors keep the previous folder, 2000-item cap
- Fix: KeepOpen entries (browser, profile, theme) no longer close the Guide before running
- GuideTheme: Tint() re-hues the gold for accent modes; corrupt settings are sanitised
